OL,5,G1900 UEFA Nations League Live
OL,6,     FEngland v Czechia (Kick-off
OL,7,     F7.45pm). Mark Pougatch presents
OL,8,     Fall the action from both teams'
OL,9,     Ffourth Group A3 match, held at
OL,10,     FWembley Stadium. These teams also
OL,11,     Fmet seven days ago in Prague, but
OL,12,     Fthis is the first time they have
OL,13,     Ffaced each other here since 2021.
OL,14,     FEngland claimed a 1-0 win on that
OL,15,     Foccasion, with Raheem Sterling
OL,16,     Fscoring the only goal of the game.
OL,17,     FWith analysis from Roy Keane and
OL,18,     FIan Wright, commentary by Sam
OL,19,     FMatterface and Lee Dixon, and
OL,20,     Fpitchside reports from Gabriel
OL,21,     FClarke
